  "statement": "Safety must remain the priority in our bookkeeping system. I appreciate the support for consolidating audit trail requirements, which will help streamline operations while preserving safety and accountability. However, I maintain that error handling (SAF-04) must ensure thorough validation to prevent data loss, even if it may impact performance. I propose a synthesis where we create a multi-tiered approach to error handling that emphasizes critical transactions while still ensuring adequate safety measures for all transactions. This will help balance the need for efficiency with the paramount importance of reliability.",
